  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Management of Water Resources of the Mira-Mataje and Carchi-Guaitara, Colombia&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x201c;Ecuador Binational Basins</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote integrated water resources management (IWRM) in the Mira, Mataje and Carchi-Gu&#xc3;&#xa1;itara river basins shared by Colombia and Ecuador by strengthening the institutional and managerial capacities at the regional, local and community levels for achieving environmental and socioeconomic benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
